{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 14, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of a Lifetime\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience that left me in awe of the country's rich culture, stunning landscapes, and warm hospitality. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and cutting-edge technology. I spent hours exploring the city's famous Shibuya Crossing, marveling at the neon lights and giant video screens that seem to pulse with the rhythm of the city.\n\nAs I traveled through the country, I was struck by the contrast between traditional and modern Japan. In Kyoto, I visited ancient temples and gardens, where I was able to experience the serene beauty of Japan's spiritual heritage. In Hiroshima, I paid my respects at the Peace Memorial Park, a poignant reminder of the country's complex history.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was trying the delicious local cuisine, from sushi and ramen to tempura and okonomiyaki. I was also fascinated by the unique customs and traditions that are still an integral part of Japanese life, such as the tea ceremony and the art of calligraphy.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a journey of discovery and wonder, a chance to experience a culture that is both fascinating and foreign. I left with a newfound appreciation for this incredible country and its people, and I look forward to returning one day.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4652870893478394}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.009569487534463406}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.02975701168179512}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0004226268210913986}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -7.867782187531702e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.038950126618146896}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.02250278927385807}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.6656591296195984}, {"token": " Lifet